WEBVTT

00:10:59.077 --> 00:11:02.667
Imagjinoni sikur te udhetoni me zerin e dikujt tjeter

00:11:02.667 --> 00:11:04.860
per nente vjet

00:11:04.860 --> 00:11:09.704
dhe pastaj te gjeni zerin tuaj.

00:11:09.704 --> 00:11:11.081
Imagjinojeni

00:11:11.081 --> 00:11:13.878
Kjo eshte ajo qe Williami tha:

00:11:13.878 --> 00:11:18.341
"Nuk e kisha degjuar asnjehere veten."

00:11:20.417 --> 00:11:22.036
Faleminderit.

00:11:22.036 --> 00:11:26.760
(duartrokitje)